Package: xgbackup
Version: 0.3.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: btrfs-progs, openssh-server, whiptail
Maintainer: Andy Henson <xgbackup@localhost>
Description: Linux backup vault
 Clients push into per-client drop areas. The vault keeps read-only
 btrfs snapshots on hourly (optional), daily, weekly, monthly, and yearly
 schedules. Everyday client keys cannot delete snapshot history.
